	(text "5 V: TI's TPS54360 5 V / 3.5 A reference design (datasheet SLVSBB4G, Figure 34), unchanged.\nRated to 60 V input, so whatever the TVS lets through a load dump cannot destroy it.\nR41/R42 start it at 8 V and stop it at 6.25 V. R43 sets 600 kHz. R44/R45 set 5.0 V.\nC23 is the bootstrap for the high-side switch; D13 carries the current while it is off.\nR46, C26, C27 compensate the control loop. Lay out C21/C22, U1, D13 and L1 as one tight loop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5fd01878-4428-49b3-825c-10ffdc72dbac")
	)
